  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nImmerse yourself in a boundless adventure at the heart of Etera extraordinary journey through an imaginary world.<p></p>\n<p>You have to overcome many obstacles in this side scroller adventure, while finding yourself in scenarios rich in detail and complexity, where the thin line between reality and fantasy dissolves.</p>\n<p>Measure your skill in timing, coordination, and strategy as you carefully plan each move to reach the end of your journey.</p>\n<p>Each level will be unique, with intricate tracks that require agility and quick reflexes.</p>\n<p>You’ll be constantly challenged by new obstacles and traps that will try to stop you on your way to the end.</p>\n<p>Navigate through environments so realistic they seem tangible, yet surreal enough to capture your imagination with a unique blend of familiar and unexpected elements.</p>\n<p>Every moment will mark the pace of your quest, influencing the plot and direction of your journey.</p>\n<p>Face challenges in a mutable timeline, where the past and the future intertwine.</p>\n<p>Indulge in the luxury of experiencing the magic of never-before-seen worlds, where climatic adversities become either a precious ally or a insidious adversary.</p>\n<p>Climb, run, and reach the highest peaks. Take on the challenge and discover what is your purpose inside Etera!</p>\n",
